       logs (farthest-point-sampled over x,y,yaw; penetration-filtered; arm away from box).
       Full 30-vec qpos = [robot 23 | box 7]; the robot 23 is the REAL logged pose recorded
       alongside that box pose. Load one in autonomous mode to run the recommender + jog from
       a controlled config (viewer: cycle keyframes, or mj_resetDataKeyframe by name/index).
       Regenerate via scratchpad/sample_keyframes.py. -->
